        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we have developed and administer company-wide policies to ensure a safe and fair workplace free of discrimination or harassment for each team member and compliance with Occupational Safety and Health Administration (“OSHA”) standards, as further discussed in our Code of Business Conduct and Ethics.",
        "start_character": 28570,
        "end_character": 28882
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2024, we announced our progress towards developing new solutions for produced water in the Permian Basin through our wholly owned subsidiary, Transmissive Water Services, LLC (“Transmissive”).",
        "start_character": 18360,
        "end_character": 18555
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On the water solutions side of our business, we developed a tailored ESG program that addresses the ethical and responsible buildout of water assets and management of water as a natural resource.",
        "start_character": 24662,
        "end_character": 24857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business in two reportable segments: Land and Resource Management and Water Services and Operations.",
        "start_character": 8263,
        "end_character": 8378
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, as discussed above under “Recent Developments,” we recently entered into a strategic agreement with Bolt to develop and enable large scale data center campuses and supporting infrastructure across our land.",
        "start_character": 11675,
        "end_character": 11895
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "After successfully testing a pilot program in our research and development lab, we proceeded with development of a produced water desalination test facility, which we refer to as the Phase 2B facility, with an initial capacity of 10,000 barrels of produced water per day.",
        "start_character": 19254,
        "end_character": 19525
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we do not produce oil or gas from the land from which our royalty revenue stream is derived, we developed our sustainability goals and partnership opportunities in consultation with the entities operating on our land.",
        "start_character": 24441,
        "end_character": 24661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over the last few years, we have been working with a leading industrial technology and manufacturing firm to develop an energy-efficient desalination and treatment process and associated equipment that can recycle produced water into fresh water with quality standards appropriate for surface discharge and beneficial reuse.",
        "start_character": 18556,
        "end_character": 18880
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001811074-26-000018-43df89a7a1041703",
        "accession_number": "0001811074-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to sustainability and responsible stewardship across all of our operations and land management activities.",
        "start_character": 24317,
        "end_character": 24440
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001811074-26-000018",
